{"parentUuid":"569b52b0-c675-4f86-bcfb-c9c7f6f6cded","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"263c4537-7eaf-4141-8243-2bd92971b2f2","agentId":"a656b69d449b928b7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01A3Coj4XhQ3YZfvLcWPk3mr","type":"tool_result","content":"# Recent Commits on or-tools Main Branch (2026-01 to 2026-05)\n\nBased on the provided GitHub commits page, here are the most recent commits displayed:\n\n## All Listed Commits (May 7 - March 31, 2026)\n\nThe page shows commits from **May 7, 2026 down to March 31, 2026**. However, **none of the visible commits directly target the ortools/sat/ directory** based on their titles.\n\n### Notable Commits (General):\n\n| SHA Prefix | Date | Title | Summary |\n|-----------|------|-------|---------|\n| 0b94fad | May 7 | graph: fix few benchmark implem. | Graph benchmark implementation corrections |\n| d35af35 | May 7 | ortools: export benchmarks from g3 | Benchmark export from internal systems |\n| fbcf7d8 | May 7 | cmake: fix sat build | SAT-related CMake build fix |\n| 3cdc8b7 | May 4 | fix(sat): correct documentation and validation in cp_model.py | Documentation and validation improvements for SAT CP model |\n\n### Keywords Search Results:\nThe visible commits do not prominently feature the requested keywords (subsolver, parameter, performance, no_overlap, scheduling, cumulative, presolve, cuts, LNS, search strategy) in their titles.\n\n**Note:** To find SAT-specific commits with your target keywords, you would need to navigate further through the commit history or filter by the ortools/sat/ directory directly on GitHub."}]},"uuid":"cfb039f7-683f-4f4a-b42e-579b1ea27e4e","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:08:29.906Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"569b52b0-c675-4f86-bcfb-c9c7f6f6cded","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"72d883fb-a45e-488c-bfec-853c0bc53d0a","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"263c4537-7eaf-4141-8243-2bd92971b2f2","agentId":"a656b69d449b928b7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RPa7c1WDfnHpAHwdhNMRCL","type":"tool_result","content":"# Merged PRs in google/or-tools since 2026-01-12\n\nBased on the GitHub pull requests page, here are the merged PRs matching your criteria:\n\n## CP-SAT Related\n\n**#5149 - \"cp-sat: fix typos and improve docstrings in cp_model.py\"**\n- Merged: May 4, 2026\n- Author: chripiermarini\n- Labels: Bug, Lang: Python, Solver: CP-SAT Solver\n- Summary: Documentation improvements and bug fixes in the CP-SAT Python module\n\n## Graph/Algorithm Related\n\n**#5155 - \"Export benchmarks from google3\"**\n- Merged: May 7, 2026\n- Author: Mizux\n- Labels: Build: Bazel, Lang: C++, Solver: Graph and Algorithm\n- Summary: Exports benchmark data from internal Google codebase\n\n**#5154 - \"graph: Extract `Build()` from the `BaseGraph` class\"**\n- Merged: May 6, 2026\n- Author: Mizux\n- Labels: Lang: C++, Solver: Graph and Algorithm\n- Summary: Refactors graph building functionality\n\n## Routing-Related\n\n**#5101 - \"routing: fix pywraprouting build\"**\n- Merged: March 26, 2026\n- Author: Mizux\n- Labels: Bug, Build: CMake, python, Solver: Routing\n- Summary: Resolves compilation issues in Python routing wrapper\n\nThe remaining 70 merged PRs primarily address build infrastructure, dependency updates, and general maintenance."}]},"uuid":"a65e45ce-cf4b-43d6-a76e-a7a1ab752d51","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:08:33.193Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"72d883fb-a45e-488c-bfec-853c0bc53d0a","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"ed19c730-6f15-4956-af1a-5af0c05b24c4","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"263c4537-7eaf-4141-8243-2bd92971b2f2","agentId":"a656b69d449b928b7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ATLb82cHwS3AbWMP7VgYWd","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"OR-Tools 9.16 release roadmap milestone CP-SAT 2026\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"OR-Tools Release Notes | Google for Developers\",\"url\":\"https://developers.google.com/optimization/support/release_notes\"},{\"title\":\"Releases · google/or-tools\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/releases\"},{\"title\":\"or-tools-discuss - Google Groups\",\"url\":\"https://groups.google.com/g/or-tools-discuss\"},{\"title\":\"CP-SAT Solver | OR-Tools | Google for Developers\",\"url\":\"https://developers.google.com/optimization/cp/cp_solver\"},{\"title\":\"Parameters - The CP-SAT Primer - Using and Understanding Google OR-Tools' CP-SAT Solver\",\"url\":\"https://d-krupke.github.io/cpsat-primer/05_parameters.html\"},{\"title\":\"OR-Tools Laurent Perron (lperron@google.com)\",\"url\":\"https://egon.cheme.cmu.edu/ewo/docs/CP-SAT%20and%20OR-Tools.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"ortools · PyPI\",\"url\":\"https://pypi.org/project/ortools/\"},{\"title\":\"or-tools/ortools/sat/docs/README.md at stable · google/or-tools\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools/blob/stable/ortools/sat/docs/README.md\"},{\"title\":\"ortools.sat.python.cp_model API documentation\",\"url\":\"https://or-tools.github.io/docs/pdoc/ortools/sat/python/cp_model.html\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - google/or-tools: Google's Operations Research tools: · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/google/or-tools\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found some relevant information about OR-Tools and CP-SAT, though the results don't contain specific details about an OR-Tools 9.16 release roadmap milestone for CP-SAT in 2026.\n\nHere's what I found:\n\n**Current Version Information:**\nThe latest available version mentioned in the search results is OR-Tools 9.15.6755, which was uploaded on January 14, 2026.\n\n**CP-SAT Recent Updates:**\nRecent support additions include Rocky Linux 9 support and Ubuntu 24.04 LTS support. Additionally, recent versions bumped dependencies including Abseil 20250512.0, Protobuf v31.1, gTest 1.17.0, and Benchmark 1.9.2.\n\n**GitHub Releases:**\nThe search results point to the GitHub releases page for OR-Tools, which would be the most authoritative source for release notes and roadmap information. However, the specific OR-Tools 9.16 release roadmap and CP-SAT 2026 milestone details you're looking for are not visible in these search results.\n\nTo find the specific roadmap information you're seeking, I recommend checking the official GitHub releases page at https://github.com/google/or-tools/releases or the OR-Tools documentation at https://developers.google.com/optimization, as those are the primary sources for release planning and milestones.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"33298a6e-da29-4d57-b244-f3349f6941a0","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:08:33.623Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ed19c730-6f15-4956-af1a-5af0c05b24c4","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
