{"parentUuid":"89116c20-bffe-419c-8a78-26e8112f68aa","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"263c4537-7eaf-4141-8243-2bd92971b2f2","agentId":"a656b69d449b928b7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DaeXPCuGgKU18tSvENmVxp","type":"tool_result","content":"# Commits to sat_parameters.proto Since January 12, 2026\n\nBased on the GitHub history page, here are the commits after 2026-01-12:\n\n| SHA | Date | Title |\n|-----|------|-------|\n| b3d4c95 | Jan 7, 2026 | \"[CP-SAT] fix vivification bug; more work on encodings\" |\n| 8deba9a | Dec 18, 2025 | \"fixes\" |\n| 5d97307 | Dec 12, 2025 | \"[CP-SAT] more work on lrat; cleanup memory management in scheduling clauses; improve encoded only variable expansion; fix a few bugs\" |\n| 142e752 | Dec 4, 2025 | \"[CP-SAT] morework on lrat\" |\n| 7051b66 | Nov 28, 2025 | \"[CP-SAT] work on lrat; work in inprocessing; fix bug with reduced variables domains and hints\" |\n| 402aef7 | Nov 23, 2025 | \"[CP-SAT] more work on lrat; expose response.solve_log in C#, Java, python\" |\n| 75d10ed | Nov 12, 2025 | \"[CP-SAT] work on lrat; probing; variable encoding\" |\n| 600a17f | Oct 30, 2025 | \"[CP-SAT] more work on lrat, encoding optimization; clauses engine optimization; clause congruence implementation\" |\n| c2d8dd4 | Oct 16, 2025 | \"[CP-SAT] work on integer resolution; lrat proofs; optimize scheduling cuts; fix #4875\" |\n\n**Note:** The page displays commit metadata but does not provide the actual `.proto` file content showing specific parameter additions, enum values, or deprecations. A detailed analysis of parameter changes would require accessing the file diffs themselves."}]},"uuid":"b0865d9b-8f59-4e6c-84c8-9c1f0580208f","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:08:47.589Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"89116c20-bffe-419c-8a78-26e8112f68aa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zoom