{"parentUuid":"bf27c641-0a62-4cdc-9fac-8a1ee7b963f1","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"263c4537-7eaf-4141-8243-2bd92971b2f2","agentId":"a656b69d449b928b7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01J5EKgKF4X6qYFmS5zampgd","type":"tool_result","content":"# Highest Field Tag Number and Last 10 Fields in SatParameters\n\n## Highest Tag Number\nThe highest field tag number used in the SatParameters message is **361**, assigned to `inprocessing_use_transitive_reduction`.\n\n## Last 10 Fields (Highest Tag Numbers)\n\n| Tag | Field Name | Type | Default Value |\n|-----|-----------|------|----------------|\n| 361 | inprocessing_use_transitive_reduction | bool | true |\n| 360 | cp_model_pure_sat_presolve | bool | false |\n| 359 | mip_presolve_restrict_bounds | bool | true |\n| 358 | mip_scale_to_max_bound | bool | false |\n| 357 | detect_encoded_complex_domain | bool | true |\n| 356 | num_ordering_in_vivification | int32 | 1 |\n| 355 | subsume_during_vivification | bool | true |\n| 354 | inprocessing_use_sat_sweeping | bool | false |\n| 353 | decision_subsumption_during_conflict_analysis | bool | true |\n| 352 | check_merged_lrat_proof | bool | false |\n\n## Notable LNS and Subsolver Parameters\n\nRecent additions include parameters for **local search (LS) strategies**, including feasibility jump heuristics (`feasibility_jump_*` parameters), violation local search (`num_violation_ls`), and shared tree search capabilities. The message supports specification of subsolver configurations through the `subsolvers` and `subsolver_params` repeated fields, allowing portfolio-based parallel solving with customizable worker strategies."}]},"uuid":"2869c0a3-edd6-490d-ab1f-3e1675f6c122","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:08:50.157Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"bf27c641-0a62-4cdc-9fac-8a1ee7b963f1","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squish