{"parentUuid":"d32583af-5405-4767-a557-66a4d9dbc2c3","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"263c4537-7eaf-4141-8243-2bd92971b2f2","agentId":"a656b69d449b928b7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Hop7vSDuYuh9gDCKsNBX8P","type":"tool_result","content":"# Commit Analysis: c38c95e\n\n## Overview\nThis commit performs a \"big cleanup; rename bazel targets, move code around\" with work on CP-SAT gates and LNS/LS model reductions.\n\n## Key Changes\n\n**Files Modified:** 142 files changed with +7,186 and -2,713 lines\n\n### Main Areas Affected:\n\n1. **Bazel Target Renaming:**\n   - `knapsack_solver_lib` renamed to `knapsack_solver` across multiple BUILD files\n   - Dependency updates from `//ortools/linear_solver` to `//ortools/linear_solver:linear_solver_base`\n   - String dependency refined to `@abseil-cpp//absl/strings:string_view`\n\n2. **CP-SAT Gates Work:**\n   - `gate_congruence_closure.cc` (modified)\n   - `gate_utils.cc`, `gate_utils.h`, `gate_utils_test.cc` (all modified)\n   - Indicates gate infrastructure enhancements\n\n3. **Model Reductions:**\n   - `cp_model_lns.cc` and `cp_model_lns.h` (LNS model reductions)\n   - `cp_model.cc` and related files updated\n   - `constraint_violation.cc`, `constraint_violation.h` (modified)\n\n4. **Code Organization:**\n   - Test reorganization in `ortools/algorithms/BUILD.bazel`\n   - Comment cleanup (removed placeholder comments)\n\n## Parameters & Subsolvers\nThe provided content does not show detailed changes to `sat_parameters.proto` or new subsolver name additions. Those modifications, if present, appear in sections beyond the displayed file diff content."}]},"uuid":"4045e43c-ec4a-4cd0-b23b-cfcbc488aa57","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:09:02.531Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d32583af-5405-4767-a557-66a4d9dbc2c3","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sp