{"parentUuid":"fb1098b9-435d-4ac3-a730-ce1ba96fb0b2","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"263c4537-7eaf-4141-8243-2bd92971b2f2","agentId":"a656b69d449b928b7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01K69GTm2XjsQAfmgHTd81Qz","type":"tool_result","content":"# Summary of \"many small fixes\" Commit (74585b4)\n\n## Files Modified\nThe commit changes **12 files** across examples and build configurations:\n\n**Examples (C++):**\n- `dobble_ls.cc`, `linear_solver_protocol_buffers.cc`, `nqueens.cc`, `qap_sat.cc`\n- `examples/cpp/BUILD.bazel`\n\n**Build & Configuration:**\n- `ortools/graph/BUILD.bazel` and `java/BUILD.bazel`\n- `ortools/sat/java/BUILD.bazel` and `CMakeLists.txt`\n- File renamed: `gen_sat_java_swig.cc` → `gen_cp_model_proto_swig.cc`\n\n**Utility:**\n- `ortools/util/java/BUILD.bazel` and `CMakeLists.txt`\n\n## Key Changes\n\n**Include/Dependency Updates:**\n- Replaced deprecated ortools-specific headers with Abseil equivalents (`absl/flags`, `absl/log`, `absl/time`)\n- Removed unused imports (`#include <algorithm>`, `<cstdio>`, `<map>`)\n\n**Build System:**\n- Added `SAFE_FP_CODE` flag for floating-point safety in `mps_driver`\n- Updated dependency references (e.g., `//ortools/lp_data:base` → `//ortools/lp_data:lp_types`)\n- Renamed build targets for clarity\n\n## Constraint Solver Changes\n**No changes detected** in scheduling, no_overlap, cumulative, diffn, presolve, or cuts modules. This commit focuses on code modernization and build configuration updates rather than algorithmic fixes."}]},"uuid":"2f921bc4-1c57-4d3f-bc8b-44f14176d03e","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:09:04.478Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"fb1098b9-435d-4ac3-a730-ce1ba96fb0b2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"488c1b5a-b382-436a-bb8d-8a18c961507d","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"263c4537-7eaf-4141-8243-2bd92971b2f2","agentId":"a656b69d449b928b7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Y4baKM3sNiNvMugSa1Rz8V","type":"tool_result","content":"# Commit Analysis: CP-SAT LNS Model Simplification and max_hs Reimplementation\n\n## Overview\nThis commit modifies 32 files in the OR-Tools SAT solver, primarily focusing on Local Neighborhood Search (LNS) model simplification and reimplementing the max_hs component.\n\n## Key File Changes\n\n**Core modifications:**\n- `cp_model_lns.cc` and `.h` - LNS-related functionality updates\n- `max_hs.cc` - Primary reimplementation of the max_hs algorithm\n- `synchronization.cc/h` - Subsolver coordination updates\n- Build configuration files (`BUILD.bazel`, `CMakeLists.txt`)\n\n## What is max_hs?\n\nBased on context clues, max_hs appears to be a hitting set maximization algorithm used within the CP-SAT solver's optimization pipeline, likely part of the constraint propagation and search strategy.\n\n## Notable Changes\n\n**Dependencies added:**\n- `saturated_arithmetic` utility\n- `strong_vector` support\n- Additional Abseil libraries (containers, algorithms)\n\n**Removals:**\n- `lrat_checker_main.cc` from CMake build\n- Some previously required dependencies\n\nThe commit reorganizes internal solver architecture to streamline model handling while maintaining optimization capabilities, though specific parameter additions aren't detailed in this diff view."}]},"uuid":"778d7d2d-07bf-4681-ac6e-e618977a4202","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:09:04.538Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"488c1b5a-b382-436a-bb8d-8a18c961507d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"c78c2390-8ca6-4562-b2f5-fc8fd746a59f","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"263c4537-7eaf-4141-8243-2bd92971b2f2","agentId":"a656b69d449b928b7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BAwPKoQkSxQV9vnyxXk6D6","type":"tool_result","content":"# Summary of Commit 800e1f6\n\nBased on the GitHub commit page, this commit addresses CP-SAT scheduling issues, but the specific details of which bugs were fixed are not fully documented in the visible content.\n\n## What Changed\n\nThe commit modified four files:\n- `ortools/sat/CMakeLists.txt` (1 line added)\n- `ortools/sat/debug_solution.cc` (229 lines added)\n- `ortools/sat/debug_solution.h` (120 lines added)\n- `ortools/sat/lrat_checker_main.cc` (changes not fully shown)\n\n## Key Addition: Debug Solution Class\n\nThe commit introduces a new `DebugSolution` class that \"can check that various derived constraint do not exclude this solution\" for debugging purposes. This includes methods to validate clauses and linear constraints against known solutions.\n\n## Limitations\n\nThe commit message title mentions \"fix scheduling bugs: wrong explanations; unsafe heuristics\" but the actual file diffs don't reveal specific details about which constraints (no_overlap, cumulative, etc.) were affected or how many users might be impacted.\n\nTo understand the exact scheduling bug fixes, you would need to review the full commit details on GitHub or check associated issue reports."}]},"uuid":"bb957268-c7fd-4f39-b816-4b342a254b73","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:09:05.584Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c78c2390-8ca6-4562-b2f5-fc8fd746a59f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
