{"parentUuid":"f80c23f7-fb7b-4bb0-a3b4-e213e4a99522","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a656b69d449b928b7","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01XYkaTCozThMRmhzVX9QX4m","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01KoQgUSvHkX3fsXowWk4bBg","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://github.com/google/or-tools/issues/5066","prompt":"What is issue #5066 about? Title, description, error case. Does it affect 9.15? Is it a scheduling or no_overlap bug?"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4072,"cache_read_input_tokens":25713,"output_tokens":662,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4072},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":662,"cache_read_input_tokens":25713,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4072,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4072,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CaotknP5pHwQs2cu5n2uS","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"c86fc8ca-c4b2-45d3-98c7-bcbf1320e39a","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:09:15.532Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"eb35c8b0-0861-4a7d-b2b1-0f8f27c3efcc","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"263c4537-7eaf-4141-8243-2bd92971b2f2","agentId":"a656b69d449b928b7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UYaorMmzSP1un3qm7fCk5k","type":"tool_result","content":"# Summary of \"[CP-SAT] work on ModelCopy\" Commit\n\n## Files Modified\nThis commit modified **37 files** across the `ortools/sat` directory, with **1,115 additions and 1,065 deletions**. Key files include:\n- `cp_model_copy.cc` and `cp_model_copy.h`\n- Multiple constraint files (`all_different.cc/h`, `circuit.cc/h`, etc.)\n- Test files and build configuration (`BUILD.bazel`)\n\n## Key Changes\nThe commit refactors how constraint functions are structured by **converting function factories that return lambdas into direct void functions**. For example:\n\n*Before:* `std::function<void(Model*)> AllDifferentBinary(...)`\n*After:* `void AddAllDifferentBinary(..., Model* model)`\n\nThis pattern change applies across multiple constraint implementations including `AllDifferentAC`, `CircuitCovering`, and `ExactlyOnePerRowAndPerColumn`.\n\n## Purpose of ModelCopy\nWhile the webpage doesn't explicitly detail ModelCopy's function, the refactoring suggests it's part of CP-SAT's constraint copying mechanism, enabling efficient model duplication.\n\n## Impact\nThese structural changes likely **improve code clarity and maintainability** rather than directly affecting runtime performance or correctness. The refactoring appears to standardize how constraints integrate with the model framework."}]},"uuid":"c23c7e6e-d351-4267-89da-3b000f5eebed","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:09:17.025Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"eb35c8b0-0861-4a7d-b2b1-0f8f27c3efcc","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"f9dad97f-b0b0-413a-90d1-4fea81609100","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"263c4537-7eaf-4141-8243-2bd92971b2f2","agentId":"a656b69d449b928b7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011XBLEvqFmZm7HCV3SQ1T2D","type":"tool_result","content":"# CP-SAT Commit Analysis\n\n## Files Modified\nThis commit spans **69 files changed** with **2,177 additions and 2,102 deletions**. Major changes include:\n\n- New `gate_congruence_closure.cc` and `.h` files\n- Updates to build configuration (BUILD.bazel, CMakeLists.txt)\n- Modifications to LRAT proof handling\n- Documentation updates across multiple solver components\n\n## Gate Congruence Closure\n\nThe commit introduces a new library called `gate_congruence_closure`. Based on the build dependencies, this component:\n\n- Integrates with the SAT solver infrastructure\n- Works alongside the LRAT proof handler\n- Depends on graph connectivity components and various utility libraries\n- Handles logical constraints through clause management\n\nHowever, **the commit content provided does not explain the underlying algorithm or its specific optimization benefits**.\n\n## Performance Impact\n\nThe web page excerpt contains **no performance metrics or benchmarking data**. While the refactoring suggests architectural improvements (organizing gate utilities into a dedicated congruence closure module), concrete performance impact information is absent from this documentation.\n\nThe changes appear to be part of ongoing solver enhancement work, with \"minor reformat\" indicating code organization improvements alongside functional additions."}]},"uuid":"0145fa97-8eb9-4d3a-9d18-2197687597c4","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:09:18.623Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f9dad97f-b0b0-413a-90d1-4fea81609100","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"c86fc8ca-c4b2-45d3-98c7-bcbf1320e39a","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"263c4537-7eaf-4141-8243-2bd92971b2f2","agentId":"a656b69d449b928b7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KoQgUSvHkX3fsXowWk4bBg","type":"tool_result","content":"# Issue #5066 Summary\n\n**Title:** Request for Java CP-SAT 2GB limit removal similar to Python v9.14\n\n**Description:** The issue asks whether Google OR-Tools can implement a solution for Java's CP-SAT solver comparable to what Python received in version 9.14. Specifically, the requester notes that \"Python CP-SAT removed the 2GB limit in v9.14 by using C++ protobuf proxies\" and wants to know if Java's JNI interface can adopt a similar approach, as the current implementation depends on byte arrays which have inherent 2GB constraints.\n\n**Classification:**\n- **Type:** Feature request for the Java wrapper\n- **Component:** CP-SAT Solver\n- **Status:** Closed\n- **Milestone:** v10.0 Beta\n\n**Does it affect 9.15?** No information provided about version 9.15 impact in the issue content.\n\n**Bug Type:** Neither a scheduling nor no_overlap bug—this is a feature request addressing a technical limitation in the Java language binding rather than a solver algorithm issue."}]},"uuid":"4640b4ce-16eb-4c99-ac5c-18e11a37e785","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:09:19.719Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c86fc8ca-c4b2-45d3-98c7-bcbf1320e39a","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"f80c23f7-fb7b-4bb0-a3b4-e213e4a99522","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"263c4537-7eaf-4141-8243-2bd92971b2f2","agentId":"a656b69d449b928b7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WYpVk9vxUuSimRLPoBLeHH","type":"tool_result","content":"# Summary of Commit dfb573d (fix #5066)\n\n## Changes Made\n\nThis commit restructures the Java bindings for OR-Tools' CP-SAT solver by:\n\n1. **Generating SWIG files dynamically** - Creates a new `gen_sat_java_swig.cc` tool that generates `cp_model_proto.swig` at build time instead of maintaining it manually\n\n2. **Reorganizing proto bindings** - Separates CP-SAT proto handling into its own `cp_model_proto` target, making dependencies clearer\n\n3. **Build system updates** - Modifies Bazel and CMake configurations to:\n   - Add include paths for workspace root and binary directories\n   - Reorder build dependencies (util now builds before sat)\n   - Add new test (`CpModelProtoTest.java`)\n\n4. **Dependency cleanup** - Updates 24 files to use the new proto binding structure and removes redundant dependencies\n\n## Issue #5066 Details\n\nThe exact nature of issue #5066 is not visible in the provided commit view. However, based on the changes, it likely addressed problems with proto handling in Java bindings—possibly related to missing include paths or unclear proto dependencies.\n\n## Impact on Users\n\nThis appears to be an **infrastructure/build improvement** rather than a functional bug fix. It affects Java users building from source but shouldn't impact existing binaries or 9.15 release behavior."}]},"uuid":"7ef6988e-536b-427e-ab87-15c9efdadc06","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:09:20.419Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f80c23f7-fb7b-4bb0-a3b4-e213e4a99522","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
