{"parentUuid":"6cd728c3-ce5f-4f8f-b601-20b82c15c7af","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"263c4537-7eaf-4141-8243-2bd92971b2f2","agentId":"a656b69d449b928b7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018DfhBAeA7txBerkkud9nKz","type":"tool_result","content":"# CP-SAT Related Issues in v9.16 Milestone\n\nBased on the GitHub page content provided, here are the CP-SAT related issues:\n\n## Open Issues\n\n**#4988 - CpSolver.Solve() callback breaking argument change**\n- State: Open\n- Labels: Bug, Lang: Python, Solver: CP-SAT Solver\n- Author: ThomSerg\n- Opened: Jan 15, 2026\n\n## Closed Issues\n\n**#4985 - solver.status_name() raises TypeError**\n- State: Closed (completed)\n- Labels: Bug, Lang: Python, Solver: CP-SAT Solver\n- Author: gacheiro\n- Closed: Feb 26, 2026\n\n---\n\n**Note:** The milestone page displays primarily merged pull requests rather than scheduled features. The two CP-SAT bugs listed above represent the only items explicitly tagged with \"Solver: CP-SAT Solver\" in the search results. No issues specifically addressing scheduling, no_overlap, performance, parameters, presolve, or cuts filters appear in the displayed content."}]},"uuid":"aa4c829e-f004-4911-8c58-9f04649d4ee6","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:09:43.668Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"6cd728c3-ce5f-4f8f-b601-20b82c15c7af","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
