You may want to check the GitHub releases page directly at https://github.com/google/or-tools/releases to see the complete list of available versions\n\nIf you're looking for CP-SAT changes in a specific version, I'd recommend checking the releases page directly or let me know if you'd like me to search for a different version number.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"3df3c53c-367a-43b2-a226-de122c88d0cd","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:09:49.318Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"67cea016-7640-4baf-9d2c-fe62e031e2ad","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
