{"parentUuid":"0678fd77-3f10-4902-8389-eca061d28e9b","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"263c4537-7eaf-4141-8243-2bd92971b2f2","agentId":"a656b69d449b928b7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CTcnQ3jvo2aN9VrdMD65kQ","type":"tool_result","content":"# Closed Issues/PRs in v10.0 Beta Milestone\n\nBased on the GitHub page content, here are the closed items for v10.0 Beta:\n\n**Pull Requests (Merged):**\n1. #5154 - \"Extract `Build()` from the `BaseGraph` class\" (C++/Graph)\n2. #5152 - \"fix highs build on alpine\" (CMake/Build)\n3. #5149 - \"fix typos and improve docstrings in cp_model.py\" (CP-SAT/Python)\n4. #5133 - \"bump scip to v10.0.2\" (CMake/SCIP)\n5. #5127 - \"fix macos jniortools link\" (Bazel/Java)\n6. #5126 - \"update highs to v1.14.0\" (CMake/HiGHS)\n\n**Issues (Closed):**\n1. #5144 - \"`math_opt` Python API lacks interval scheduling primitives for CP-SAT\"\n2. #5138 - \"Dummy Issue (Miss click ?)\"\n3. #5134 - \"IntVar.Proto() causes segfault\" (CP-SAT/Python, marked Duplicate)\n4. #5130 - \"ci: windows cmake presubmit too many symbols\"\n5. #5118 - \"ci: linux cmake (Flaky strawberry_fields_with_column_generation test)\"\n6. #5117 - \"ci: docker cmake java error\""}]},"uuid":"e8dd0dd5-8830-4000-8a36-6dad28536e5d","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:10:16.166Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"0678fd77-3f10-4902-8389-eca061d28e9b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"e50ebc4d-ef67-4570-91fa-85534aa44022","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"263c4537-7eaf-4141-8243-2bd92971b2f2","agentId":"a656b69d449b928b7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016rksBXScdNQJddtXzWZZWu","type":"tool_result","content":"# Recent Scheduling Cuts Improvements (Since September 2025)\n\nBased on the commit history, here are the key scheduling cut improvements:\n\n**February 23, 2026:**\n- `c6772d4` - \"base: rework logging management\"\n\n**December 12, 2025:**\n- `5d97307` - \"[CP-SAT] more work on lrat; cleanup memory management in scheduling clauses; improve encoded only variable expansion; fix a few bugs\"\n\n**October 16, 2025:**\n- `c2d8dd4` - \"[CP-SAT] work on integer resolution; lrat proofs; optimize scheduling cuts; fix #4875\"\n\nThe most substantial recent enhancement focused on optimizing scheduling cuts while also implementing lrat proof support and addressing bug #4875. Additionally, memory management improvements were made for scheduling clauses to reduce resource consumption."}]},"uuid":"340bffd3-cdb5-455e-a65a-ba1252ce0b85","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:10:16.575Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e50ebc4d-ef67-4570-91fa-85534aa44022","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
