{"parentUuid":"81d7e6ee-ac96-4bdc-ac61-e69adf447250","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a656b69d449b928b7","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01VRAsx9p5aN8qz3zW8GX2JN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012JEj22SACyf7zActKiddp6","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://github.com/google/or-tools/issues/5066","prompt":"What is issue 5066 - Java 2GB limit? Confirm: Is it scheduled for v10.0 Beta? Any information on when v9.16 will release?"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1893,"cache_read_input_tokens":46124,"output_tokens":393,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1893},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":393,"cache_read_input_tokens":46124,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1893,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1893,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CaotuQMGnCcPAstEmXhKR","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"e78ce774-f5e6-406d-962f-7a0d33d07081","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:11:09.302Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"e78ce774-f5e6-406d-962f-7a0d33d07081","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0f373ebb-a92e-4bba-8942-d03ed7b7aa78","agentId":"a656b69d449b928b7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012JEj22SACyf7zActKiddp6","type":"tool_result","content":"# Issue #5066 Summary\n\n**What it is:**\nIssue #5066 requests that Java's CP-SAT solver implement a solution similar to Python's v9.14 fix, which removed the 2GB limit through C++ protobuf proxies. The Java wrapper currently relies on JNI with byte arrays, which are subject to this 2GB constraint.\n\n**Milestone:**\nYes, it is assigned to the \"v10.0 Beta\" milestone, indicating the developers have scheduled this feature request for that release cycle.\n\n**v9.16 Release Timeline:**\nThe webpage content provided does not contain information about a v9.16 release date. No release schedule or timeline details are included in this GitHub issue page."}]},"uuid":"f3b3b646-0872-46b4-b35a-fa724dc400f5","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:11:11.948Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e78ce774-f5e6-406d-962f-7a0d33d07081","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"81d7e6ee-ac96-4bdc-ac61-e69adf447250","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0f373ebb-a92e-4bba-8942-d03ed7b7aa78","agentId":"a656b69d449b928b7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AX4XtzZhnVqSvn3Hyahpdw","type":"tool_result","content":"# SAT Parameters Analysis\n\nBased on the provided GitHub blame view for `sat_parameters.proto`, I cannot locate the specific parameters you mentioned in the visible content. The file excerpt shows lines 1-362, which covers basic solver configuration like branching, polarity, conflict analysis, clause cleanup, and restart strategies.\n\n## Key Findings:\n\n**Parameters Not Visible**: The parameters \"use_dynamic_precedence_in_disjunctive,\" \"shaving,\" \"feasibility_jump,\" and \"linear_relaxation\" do not appear in the displayed section.\n\n**Recent Modifications Shown**:\n- **Feb 10, 2025**: Improvements to no_overlap_2d cuts\n- **Feb 19, 2026**: Scheduling bug fixes with \"wrong explanations; unsafe heuristics\"\n- **Dec 4, 2024**: Diffn clustering improvements and hints work\n\n**Recent Default Changes**: The visible defaults that were recently modified include `binary_minimization_algorithm`, which was changed to `BINARY_MINIMIZATION_FROM_UIP_AND_DECISIONS` (Dec 4, 2025).\n\n**File Size Note**: The file contains 1,936 total lines (1,617 lines of actual code), suggesting your target parameters likely appear further in the document beyond the visible excerpt. You would need to view lines beyond 362 to find the parameters you're investigating."}]},"uuid":"439bacba-20c1-4fdf-a0fc-23e903d4fdae","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:11:14.935Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"81d7e6ee-ac96-4bdc-ac61-e69adf447250","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"439bacba-20c1-4fdf-a0fc-23e903d4fdae","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a656b69d449b928b7","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_013c2XZ6TYChNqvgRRkZvjmJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have enough material to give a thorough briefing. Let me compose the deliverable now.\n\n---\n\n# OR-Tools main 分支自 v9.15 起的深度调研\n\n## 关键时间线发现\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|---|---|\n| v9.16 milestone | 99% 完成，原定 2026-04-24 发布，已逾期 13 天（截至昨天检查） |\n| v10.0 Beta milestone | 97% 完成，目标 2026-05-29 |\n| v10.0 milestone | 6% 完成，目标 2026-07-14 |\n\nv9.16 是 bug-fix 小版本，v10.0 才是大改（routing namespace 重构、Bazel 9、SCIP 10.0.2、Python 从 SWIG 迁到 pybind11）。\n\n## SatParameters 字段对比（最硬核的发现）\n\n- **v9.15 release tag**：NEXT TAG = 356（最高已用 = 355）\n- **main 分支当前**：NEXT TAG = 362（最高已用 = 361）\n- **新增 6 个参数**（main 比 9.15 多）：\n\n| Tag | 参数名 | 类型 | 默认 | 对我们价值 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 356 | `num_ordering_in_vivification` | int32 | 1 | 中。vivification 强度可调，70x70 大模型可能受益于调到 2-3 |\n| 357 | `detect_encoded_complex_domain` | bool | true | **高**。自动检测带洞域（[0],[2,5],[7],[9]）的编码变量并消除。我们 placement 候选位置很可能产生这种 |\n| 358 | `mip_scale_to_max_bound` | bool | false | 低。MIP-only |\n| 359 | `mip_presolve_restrict_bounds` | bool | true | 低。MIP-only |\n| 360 | `cp_model_pure_sat_presolve` | bool | false | 低。我们不是纯 SAT |\n| 361 | `inprocessing_use_transitive_reduction` | bool | true | **中**。binary implication graph 传递闭包简化，我们 master 二值变量多，可能影响 |\n\n357 + 361 是我们 placement 项目最该关注的两个新参数。\n\n## 关键 commits（按价值排序）\n\n1. **`b5105a6` (2026-02-19) [CP-SAT] fix scheduling bugs: wrong explanations; unsafe heuristics**\n   修了 `disjunctive.cc`、`scheduling_helpers.cc`、`intervals.cc`、`timetable_edgefinding.cc`、`2d_rectangle_presolve.cc`、`2d_try_edge_propagator.cc` 的 wrong-explanation 错误。**直接影响 routing/binding 子问题正确性**——9.15 用户可能命中错误 propagation 解释。是 9.16 必装的关键修复。\n\n2. **`c2d8dd4` (2025-10-16) optimize scheduling cuts; fix #4875**\n   `scheduling_cuts.cc` 优化 + 修 `interleave_search` 忽略 assumptions 的 bug。我们 outer-search 用 interleave 时要警惕。\n\n3. **`c38c95e` (2026-03-24) big cleanup; LNS and LS model reductions**\n   142 文件，+7186/-2713。LNS 子模型在恰当时刻自动降维——大模型（266 必装实例）求解时 LNS worker 可能更快收敛。\n\n4. **`2c54173` (2026-03-09) simplify lns model when possible; reimplement max_hs**\n   32 文件改动。`max_hs` 改用 CP-SAT 自身做 MIP（去掉 SCIP 依赖）。LNS 整体调度优化。\n\n5. **`f5444a1` (2026-02-25) gate congruence closure**\n   新文件 `gate_congruence_closure.cc/h`。布尔 gate 同余检测，可能压缩我们 master 大量 reified 子句。\n\n6. **`8c23ed9` (2026-02-26) work on ModelCopy**\n   37 文件，+1115/-1065。ModelCopy 接口重构（lambda → void）。我们 outer search 反复 copy 主模型的开销可能下降。\n\n7. **`b3d4c95` (2026-01-07) fix vivification bug; more work on encodings**\n   vivification 正确性 bug。9.15 cutoff 之前 5 天（9.15 是 1-12 发布），但**这个 fix 没进 9.15**（在 main 上但 release 未带）。\n\n8. **scheduling_clauses 内存管理优化**（`5d97307`, 2025-12-12）\n   减少 scheduling clause 内存占用。我们 70x70 + 266 实例的内存敏感场景值得。\n\n9. **issue #4988（v9.16 milestone, 仍 open）**：`CpSolver.Solve()` callback 参数从 `solution_callback` 改名为 `callback` 引入回归——9.15 用户会撞 TypeError。我们如果没用大写 `Solve()` 就不影响；用了的话临时切到小写 `.solve()`。\n\n10. **整 v9.16 milestone**：126 个 closed issue，但其中带 \"Solver: CP-SAT\" 标签的明确 issue 在公开搜索面里只见到 #4985 和 #4988，主要是 build/Java/Python wrapper 类。**没有 placement / no_overlap_2d 算法重大改进**——这是个关键 negative finding。\n\n## Negative findings（值得说出来）\n\n- `diffn.cc`、`no_overlap_2d_helpers.cc` 自 2025-09 没大改；2D placement 内核稳定\n- 没有新 subsolver 名出现在 `cp_model_solver_helpers.cc`，portfolio 结构未变\n- LRAT proof 仍只覆盖 SAT，没扩到 CP；外部 verifier 集成无新进展\n- 没找到带 benchmark 数字的 PR\n\n## 关键链接\n\n- [v9.16 milestone](https://github.com/google/or-tools/milestones)（99% 完成，逾期）\n- [main 上 sat_parameters.proto](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/or-tools/main/ortools/sat/sat_parameters.proto)\n- [v9.15 上 sat_parameters.proto](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/or-tools/v9.15/ortools/sat/sat_parameters.proto)\n- [commit b5105a6 scheduling bugs](https://github.com/google/or-tools/commit/b5105a6)\n- [commit c2d8dd4 scheduling cuts + #4875](https://github.com/google/or-tools/commit/c2d8dd4)\n- [commit c38c95e LNS/LS reductions](https://github.com/google/or-tools/commit/c38c95e)\n- [commit 2c54173 max_hs reimplement](https://github.com/google/or-tools/commit/2c54173)\n- [issue #4875 interleave_search ignores assumptions](https://github.com/google/or-tools/issues/4875)\n- [issue #4988 callback regression](https://github.com/google/or-tools/issues/4988)\n- [release management discussion #4598](https://github.com/google/or-tools/discussions/4598)\n\n## 建议：要不要 build from source？\n\n**不建议现在 build main 分支**，理由：\n1. v9.16 已 99% 完成、逾期 13 天，按 OR-Tools 历史 cadence 应在 **2-4 周内（即 5 月底前）发 release**\n2. main 现在还在为 v10.0 Beta（5-29）和 v10.0（7-14）做大改，混着 routing namespace 改、SWIG→pybind11、SCIP 10、Bazel 9，build from source 容易撞编译/依赖问题\n3. 我们 placement 内核（`diffn.cc`、`no_overlap_2d_*`）从 9.15 到 main 没有算法级改动；新参数中只有 357（detect_encoded_complex_domain）和 361（inprocessing_use_transitive_reduction）潜在价值，但都默认开启——升 9.16 自动得到\n4. 关键 scheduling explanation 修复（`b5105a6`）必进 9.16\n\n**建议的行动**：\n- **等 9.16**（约 2-4 周），版本到手后跑一次 S6 worker matrix 对比 9.15，重点观察 357/361 默认开启对 binding/routing 子问题的影响\n- 如果硬要现在测，**只针对单 worker 隔离测**：拉 main、build、跑 1-2 个已有 frontier 候选，对比 9.15 同一 seed 的 wall-clock，不要把 main 接入 168h 正式 production\n- v10.0（7 月）会破坏 routing API，**要预留 1-2 周适配窗口**\n\nSources:\n- [OR-Tools releases](https://github.com/google/or-tools/releases)\n- [Release management discussion](https://github.com/google/or-tools/discussions/4598)\n- [CP-SAT bottleneck issue #4783](https://github.com/google/or-tools/issues/4783)"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":266,"cache_creation_input_tokens":910,"cache_read_input_tokens":48017,"output_tokens":3147,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":910},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":266,"output_tokens":